    <section class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Christmas made easy</span><h1>A basket full of <span>holiday joy.</span></h1><p>Thoughtful Christmas gifts for family, friends, employees, and valued customers—with options for every budget at Puregold Monumento.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="tel:${RESERVATION_PHONE_LINK}">Call ${RESERVATION_PHONE_DISPLAY}</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#choices">View basket choices</a></div></div></section>
